d","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-10T18:57:27Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:36:25Z","closed_at":"2025-12-11T00:17:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113859","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113859.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113859.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-11T00:17:03Z"},"body":"Fixes #30444\r\n\r\nThis long time issue seems to be coming from a oversight. For some reason, in `editor/editor_node.cpp:1722`, we check if the target resource to save as is the same as the current edited scene. If not, we deny the save as and show a popup.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d743736f84fb668bcdfb5bf86258e483f35c6fec/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1719-L1726\r\n\r\nBut another part of the code has the same check, but checks also if the target resource is of type `PackedScene` (which makes more sense).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d743736f84fb668bcdfb5bf86258e483f35c6fec/editor/editor_node.cpp#L3072-L3074\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the same `PackedScene` check to the save as command. Saving resources don't depend on the edited scene, especially for resources that aren't related to scenes at all.\r\n\r\nThis PR also cleans up the `EditorNode::save_resource_as()` method.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113859/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,